      "content": "gremlins?? lol. i mean i guess that's one way to put it, but it feels a bit more serious than just some random little prankster. \n\nif i'm setting up these logs like u said, is there a specific sign i should look for that confirms it's actually a systemic issue and not just me making a mistake? like, how do i tell the difference between a legitimate technical 'gremlin' causing a glitch and just a regular error in how the data is being processed?",
